WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.062
Section 5.

00:00:02.012 --> 00:00:04.287
The Workforce Crisis.

00:00:04.287 --> 00:00:08.275
You cannot run a healthcare system without healthcare workers.

00:00:08.275 --> 00:00:12.075
23,000 nursing vacancies nationwide.

00:00:12.075 --> 00:00:14.262
Burnout is staggering.

00:00:14.262 --> 00:00:17.912
The workforce crisis is not coming, it is here.
